{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act4d0_level_act4d0_st07",
  "groupId": "act4d0",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "Among the Light and the Dust",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act4d0/level_act4d0_st07.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4d5767dae16ba4218c287ec522db6ac8badf9b2588502d7d308da41b2e9c0b31",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmencommand"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "11:30 A.M. \\ Overcast\nCountryside - Rhodes Island Chief Engineer's Office"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What are you doing this time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Kal'tsit, you think I could see the Doctor for a bit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Has it been too long since you pranked {@nickname}? Feeling antsy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh come on! I'm really a very caring person."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Last time you called yourself a caring person, you set up a facility to broadcast 'Closure's Midnight Video Market' at twelve o'clock for three months straight."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We still have no way to turn the volume down."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Okay okay, I admit it! I want to go tease the Doctor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Not to mention {@nickname}'s memory loss. I can't say for sure if the Doctor even knows who you are."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh? Slept too much and turned stupid, huh? That's sad. I'll have to bring the Doctor some snacks as a little cheer-up gift."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whatever. Just try not to make a bad impression."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Warfarin went bad enough. Add in the Doctor's misconceptions about vampires and the Kazdel matter will have to be postponed. Indefinitely."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is an opportunity to rehabilitate yourself in the eyes of the people. Seize it well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do I really need rehabilitating?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "After the time you set the climate control system to 36 degrees, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That was a power outage in the machine shop."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We found your fingerprints on the console."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It was a power outage in the machine shop!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You hacked the surveillance system and deleted the recording, but the console served as a biological backup. I have thirteen tissue samples from thirteen different instances."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm sorry it's my bad that envoy is such an arrogant prick I just want to rub his nose in it sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Anyway, the welcome party. Dr. {@nickname}'s welcome back party. We're not throwing one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Afraid not. Circumstances such as they are."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey, why you gotta be like that, Kal'tsit? This is the Doctor we're talking about, the Doctor with amensia. We gotta create an atmosphere of warmth and camaraderie."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did you always look at the Doctor so?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Maybe... I've never been that close to the Doctor. But didn't you just say this is the perfect time to make a good impression?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Closure, let's talk about something else."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmph. If you're not going, I'll go myself. I don't care what you do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did I hear we're going to Lungmen? I think that was on the schedule."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And we can operate freely?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lungmen has become quite dangerous."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh? Really? Lungmen? I thought that place was all about law and order."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's the closest city to Chernobog. That should be pretty self-explanatory."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So why are we going?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Because it's the closest city to Chernobog."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I think you're hiding something..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No. I said everything there is to be said in the last meeting. Right about the time you were slumped back in your chair, wearing an eye mask, fast asleep."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What can I say? Keeping this operation well maintained is tiring work."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I never said I blamed you. Without you, Rhodes Island wouldn't even get off the ground."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I still want to do away with your suspicions... What is it you called me in for, exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What? I can't just call up an old friend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll be in my lab."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey! Wait! Okay... we have a power outage down two corridors in sector three."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Can you come look at the cables with me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just send an engineer down there. Is it a problem with the power supply cables?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Or the two of us could go look ourselves."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whenever I ask you for an inspection, you always delegate it to another operator."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My sense of responsibility as Chief Engineer of Rhodes Island has suddenly awakened! Let's go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Come on, keep up with me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is Heavyrain."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh. Heavyrain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hello, Miss Closure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What a good little girl! Look, Kal'tsit, look how much more likable she is than you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmph."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heavyrain, let me see your monitor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This one...? On my left arm here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes. Be careful not to touch the needle."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Numbers look good. Your hemoglobin is up. You're recovering well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thank you, Dr. Kal'tsit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No thanks necessary. Just doing my job. You don't thank people for that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You know the way back, Heavyrain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then you show yourself out. Closure and I have something to take care of."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I'm a guard. If I go, will you be okay, Dr. Kal'tsit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You may be mistaken, Heavyrain."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I asked you to come with us just to give you a the layout of the ship. You may not come here often in the future."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't need protection."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Heavyrain",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then, excuse me. Goodbye, Miss Closure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yeah, bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bridge"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did you hear that, Kal'tsit? She called me 'Miss!' Oh what a good little girl..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She really seemed to want to help you out. And you sent her away like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Every operator has to find her own place in the world, just like me. Having her waste time with things she's not good at doesn't help anybody."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Would it kill you to talk like a human being every once in a while?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heavyrain was in the Sargon military."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Before she can establish interpersonal relationships, she needs to find a proper position for herself and integrate into Rhodes Island. That requires both support and tolerance, as well as her own self-awareness."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yeah yeah, your lectures make my head hurt."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She another one of your strays you brought home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ri_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You kind of have a talent for picking up new pets, Kal'tsit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How many are we up to now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's one of the steps in the 'Acquisition and Cultivation Procedures for Infected Personnel.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hold on... Last month, you had a solid 72-hour surgical procedure. Was that her you were operating on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Indeed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The surgical team went through like eight or nine shifts, but you didn't sleep for three days?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "At least she recovered quickly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Tell me, Kal'tsit, do you drug yourself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I refuse to answer that question."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If I don't ask, you'll never say, will you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's the point of discussing this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're too hard on yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can handle it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dark!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Should we be using backup power?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You can't see?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm a vampire, of course I can see."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So can I."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All right then, on we go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now I know what I just said, but did I step on something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Augh! Wh- what is this!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Nothing to get all upset about..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is that... a gachapon machine? What's it doing here?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh. 'Furry Friends Collection. 12 different furry friends to...' Wow, secret level! Awesome!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Clo-sure!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's been a long time since I worked in a dark pipeline like this. I really missed it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And Rhodes Island wasn't nearly this big back then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Spanner, please!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thanks, Mon3tr!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can't reach it. Can you give me a boost so I can fix the cable?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oof... This whole area has been totally cut off from the power supply. We can start troubleshooting."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Kal'tsit, do you think it was a mistake to go to Chernobog and rescue the Doctor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It was certainly unwise to enter Chernobog at that time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Amiya was very firm in her decision. No one could sway her. And you know how the elite operators are."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It only happened because you abstained."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm starting to think this was some kind of test of Amiya?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Test? No, not a test. Or rather if it was a test, it wasn't me administering it. It was the situation she found herself in."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But as firmly as she believed in that decision, I could only support her... Though I certainly didn't have to make her feel like it would all go smoothly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Her choice is her choice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well said. But you're the one who has to deal with the consequences. Aren't you tired...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Nobody gets it all right from beginning to end, Closure. Not even me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But we made it through the darkness. Now we just wait for the light at the end of the tunnel."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Also, that second cable right above your head is about to fall."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey hey hey! Hold me steady! If the three-pin power connector drops, that's the end of both of us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Okay, hold up, I'm laying out the wire."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did you just stuff two whole sets of wires in behind them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Shhh! I must feel the thrum of the electricity in my own heart, to achieve peace and balance with the current."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I advise you to mull over what you just said."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But, Kal'tsit... Oh, should be good. Try the switch."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I was saying, regardless of what kind of riddle you were just playing at, if you're walking in the dark, you need some kind of light, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Aren't we fixing the lights right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yeah, there we go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Closure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why are you asking me about these things?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Because if I don't ask, you don't tell."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You let it all well up inside you until you go crazy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So my answers don't even matter to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I think all these things you told me are reeeeeeaaally important, to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So yeah it's not that important what you say... but it's really super important that you say it, and I hear it with my own two ears."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What a waste of time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Next time I'll just hand you the written report."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But then you wouldn't come with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Says who?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As long as you really have some lights that need fixing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Promise?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How is it I always end up making some strange, inexplicable deal with you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's what an engineer does!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here, Kal'tsit, take a look at this light bulb."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's very clear?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yeah, clear!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If only you were like this all the time, I'd be a lot less tense."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If only..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Woah! Shut up! Don't say it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just be quiet... and enjoy this little light together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It really is a nice, gentle light."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
